<doctext field_name="doctext">The high bit does not need to be masked.  Something like:
&lt;c&gt;
for my $x (0..0xff) {
    my $y = ( $x &amp; 0x80 ) ?  -($x ^ 0xff) : $x;
    say "$x $y"
}
&lt;/c&gt;
</doctext>
